# Strategy v2.0 Specification: DRAFT (freezes on Week 7 Day 2)

## Universe
- Current S&P 500 constituents (survivorship bias acknowledged in DATA_NOTES.md)
- A stock is eligible on a date only if all three signals are valid

## Signals (computed at month-end close, using data up to and including that day)
1. Momentum: close[t-21] / close[t-252] - 1
2. Low volatility: -(std of daily returns over the trailing 252 days)
3. Short-term reversal: -(close[t] / close[t-21] - 1)

## Standardisation
- Winsorise each signal at the 5th and 95th percentile across stocks, per date
- Cross-sectional z-score per date
- Combined score = equal-weighted average of the three z-scores

## Parameters
- 252, 21, 252, 5%/95%
- sensitivity to be tested later

## Checks done
- Look-ahead test passed on [N] random development-period dates
